# FamGuard runtime configuration
#
# Copy to .env for local development (never commit real values).
# These are the only two variables the app needs. Both are browser-safe:
# the publishable key is shipped to every client and your existing Supabase
# row level security policies are what protect the data.
#
# NEVER add a service_role or secret key here. server/app.ts refuses to serve
# a configuration whose key is a service-role JWT or an sb_secret_ key.

SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_your_publishable_key

# Optional: port the Express server listens on (defaults to 3000).
# PORT=3000
